Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.44,0:00:51.24,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,REINKARNASI SANTA AGUNG YANG MENYEMBUNYIKAN\NJATI DIRINYA SEBAGAI SANTA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.98,0:02:05.44,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,EPISODE 1: KEBANGKITAN SANTA AGUNG
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.20,0:02:19.91,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,PUTRI PERTAMA KELUARGA KESATRIA RUUD, ORIA RUUD
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:25.73,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,PUTRA KEDUA KELUARGA KESATRIA RUUD, LEON RUUD
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:34.18,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,PUTRA PERTAMA KELUARGA KESATRIA RUUD, ARDIO RUUD
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.75,0:02:36.64,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,KEPALA KELUARGA KESATRIA RUUD, DOLF RUUD
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.15,0:03:06.96,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,PUTRI KEDUA KELUARGA KESATRIA RUUD, FIA RUUD
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:44.16,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,EPISODE 2: FIA DAN ORDO KESATRIA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menjelang ajal, katanya orang\Nakan mengingat seluruh kilas hidupnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat diserang monster\Ndan kehilangan banyak darah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.57,0:00:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang teringat olehku adalah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gila! Kekuatan macam apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hukum dunia bisa-bisa kacau!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.97,0:00:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}...kehidupan masa laluku sebagai santa agung.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin melakukan upacara kedewazaam!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Li-Lidahku keseleo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:16.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pokoknya tidak boleh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.13,0:02:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau melakukannya, kamu pasti mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.91,0:02:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bakat berpedangnya nihil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Latih tanding kemarin saja kalah terus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.73,0:02:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi ada setengah kemungkinan\Ndia akan selamat, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.59,0:02:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti setengahnya lagi akan mati, dong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.71,0:02:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fia, Ayah itu wakil kapten ordo kesatria.\NAku dan para abang juga kesatria.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:47.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keluarga kita pasti bertahan\Nke generasi selanjutnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pilih saja pekerjaan yang kamu sukai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.69,0:02:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku mau jadi kesatria.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku Fia Ruud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.15,0:03:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebagai Keluarga Kesatria Ruud yang terhormat,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}upacara kedewasaan akan kujalani.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.02,0:03:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku terlalu bermulut besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, jadi kesatria adalah\Ncita-citaku sejak kecil!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.98,0:03:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mbak, ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau memberikan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini ramuan penyembuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.66,0:03:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Minumlah saat kamu dilukai monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.28,0:03:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bukan ramuan serbabisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak bisa menyembuhkan luka parah\Ndan organ yang putus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.66,0:03:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi sebaiknya jangan sampai terluka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.57,0:03:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mbak Oria...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, kamu tahu aturan\Nupacara kedewasaan Keluarga Ruud, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.01,0:04:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Calon kesatria harus membawa pulang batu sihir\Ndari tubuh monster yang mereka kalahkan
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sebagai bukti kekuatan, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.22,0:04:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya aku mau yang besar...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.82,0:04:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang penting bawa batu sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.53,0:04:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Burulah monster lemah\Ndan bawa saja batu sihir yang kecil!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Paham?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.98,0:04:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.74,0:04:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidurlah, besok harus bangun pagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.24,0:04:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anu, Mbak Oria.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.29,0:04:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maukah kamu tidur bersamaku sebentar?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.01,0:04:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mbak, ramuan itu dibuat dari sihir penyembuh\Nseorang santa, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, betul.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kudengar, santa yang bisa sihir penyembuh\Nsudah langka di Kerajaan Nav.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.94,0:05:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, seorang santa cuma bisa membuat\Nbeberapa ramuan dalam sehari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.90,0:05:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan itu barang mahal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bukan memberikannya biar kamu muram.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Justru biar kamu pulang dengan senyuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih banyak!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.06,0:05:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat jalan, Fia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku berangkat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.30,0:05:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perlu batu sihir yang kecil dan ringan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti tikus bermata satu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka kecil dan lemah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.57,0:06:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kok hening sekali?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anak burung
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}berwarna hitam?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.13,0:06:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perasaan apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tenanglah, tenanglah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Te-Tenanglah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski terasa sakit, lukamu akan...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betul juga,\Ntidak ada burung hitam di dunia ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:07:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang punya sayap hitam\Ncuma monster legendaris, naga hitam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.36,0:07:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tamat riwayatku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma 15 tahun, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.09,0:07:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hidupku terlalu singkat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah selesai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia sembuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.25,0:07:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih banyak, Santa Agung Serafina!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.27,0:08:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri Serafina memang hebat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Santa agung kerajaan kita!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.61,0:08:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kastel Raja Iblis sudah dekat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo maju!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.02,0:08:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya kita mengalahkan Raja Iblis!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita pahlawan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita berhasil, Abang, ayo pulang!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.97,0:08:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kehabisan sihir sampai tidak bisa\Nmemulihkan diri, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.55,0:08:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Abang, ramuan penyembuhnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Matilah di sini setelah dicabik para iblis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.03,0:09:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kamu pasti akan dicabuli dulu\Noleh iblis-iblis kotor itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan besar kepala\Nkarena dianggap santa agung.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.86,0:09:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu itu cuma barang sekali pakai, Serafina.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tangan kanan sang Raja Iblis?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.48,0:09:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu begini karena jadi santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.23,0:09:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu dipermainkan karena jadi santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.62,0:10:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu disiksa karena jadi santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.34,0:10:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu dipermalukan karena jadi santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.51,0:10:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar, ini karena aku seorang santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.46,0:10:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena jadi santa, aku dipermainkan, disiksa,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dipermalukan, dan dibunuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kamu bereinkarnasi jadi santa...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.40,0:10:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sedang apa aku di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.05,0:10:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eng...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.59,0:10:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kukukutebas!\NNininih!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.18,0:10:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Kukukutebas" itu apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga baru tahu ada kata "nininih".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lidahku keseleo, tahu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.77,0:11:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya!\NBahuku copot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:10.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perutku juga digigit...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.72,0:11:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.34,0:11:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf karena malah menggigitmu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.25,0:11:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan mengira ramuan itu adalah serangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga berterima kasih karena kamu\Nmenolongku dengan sihir penyembuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.49,0:11:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sihir penyembuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, entahlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.94,0:11:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau pulang lalu tidur.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dipikirkan nanti saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.61,0:11:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang penting tidur dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat tidur.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penyembuhan Total itu sihir tingkat tinggi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wajar kalau daya sihirmu habis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mbak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bangsa naga akan mengabdikan nyawa\Nke orang yang menolong mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.18,0:11:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi sekarang aku milikmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisakah kita menjalin kontrak abdi setia?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan begitu,\Ndaya sihirku bisa dibagi padamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong beri tahu namamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namaku?\NNamaku Fia Ruud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.30,0:12:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku raja naga hitam Zavilia, menjalin kontrak\Ndengan masterku, Fia Ruud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.72,0:12:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan darah, daging, dan jiwa ini,\Naku bersumpah setia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hangat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naga Hitam?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat pagi, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.27,0:12:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu menemaniku semalaman?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.03,0:13:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, karena melindungi Master adalah tugasku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.97,0:13:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Naga Hitam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Panggil aku Zavilia.\NBolehkah aku juga memanggilmu Fia?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Zavilia, semalam aku bermimpi\Nmenjalin kontrak penjinakan denganmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu nyata, kok.\NSekarang aku milikmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat pergelangan tangan kirimu,\Nada tandanya, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.74,0:13:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski nanti berjauhan,\Naku akan datang kalau kamu panggil,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.45,0:13:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan kamu bisa kuberi daya sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.02,0:13:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kemarin aku membagikan daya sihirku,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.74,0:13:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena kamu kehabisan daya sihir\Nakibat memakai sihir penyembuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sihir penyembuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.40,0:13:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bermimpi pernah jadi santa\Ndi kehidupan sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.65,0:13:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entah dulunya santa atau bukan,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.75,0:13:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang jelas saat ini kamu adalah santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.98,0:13:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sempat salah perhitungan dan sekarat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.80,0:14:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski mengecilkan tubuh,\Nregenerasiku kurang cepat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.30,0:14:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di situ aku pikir akan mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.99,0:14:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu kamu menolongku dengan sihir penyembuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.67,0:14:12.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Efeknya setara membangkitkan orang mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma santa sepertimu yang bisa\Nmemakai sihir setingkat itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.70,0:14:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, aku tidak bisa memakai sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.09,0:14:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin daya sihir dan ingatanmu\Nkembali sekaligus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.89,0:14:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami bangsa naga juga sering melakukannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eng, itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anu, bisakah kamu merahasiakan\Nkalau aku seorang santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja bisa, menolongmu adalah tugasku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.29,0:14:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi jangan lupa,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku akan melindungimu sekuat tenaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.67,0:15:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Duh, jadi malu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mayat monster yang mau menyerangmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.76,0:15:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena terpikat aroma darah seorang santa,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.88,0:15:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}monster-monster berdatangan semalam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya terlihat kuat juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Upacara kedewasaannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Batu sihirnya kuambil, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, aku pulang dulu\Nbiar Mbak tidak khawatir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.31,0:15:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah semua siap, ayo langsung cari Fia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.41,0:15:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia menuju kemari dengan cepat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah itu monster legendaris,\NRaja Naga Hitam?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:16:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kami yang tahan!\NAbang melapor saja ke ordo kesatria!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.15,0:16:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Manusia di punggung naga itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.40,0:16:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fia?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mbak Oria!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa hubunganmu dengan naga hitam itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eng...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.54,0:16:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Zavilia adalah temanku!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.99,0:16:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sip, jawabanku oke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.70,0:16:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau berkata jujur,\Nnanti malah ditanya ini itu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.95,0:16:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan malah terkuak bahwa aku santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.42,0:16:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Inilah jawaban paling aman,\Naku memang cerdas!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.58,0:16:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma monster kuat yang bisa punya nama.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.03,0:16:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster cuma memberi tahu nama\Nsaat mereka bersedia tunduk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benarkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.49,0:16:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak sembarang orang\Nyang boleh menyebut namanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}E-Eng...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat, aku harus mengalihkan topiknya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.75,0:17:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini batu sihirnya!\NTolong luluskan aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah? Gede amat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.61,0:17:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini cuma keluar dari monster kelas A!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.23,0:17:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berdasarkan kesulitan diburunya,\Nmonster dibagi jadi kelas A sampai H.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.94,0:17:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, di atas kelas A ada S dan SS.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naga hitam yang kamu bawa itu kelas SS.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beberapa kapten dan 300 kesatria elite saja\Nbelum tentu bisa memburunya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.92,0:17:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Be-Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.10,0:17:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ukuran batu sihir pun menunjukkan\Nkekuatan suatu monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Batu sebesar ini berasal dari monster\Nyang harus dikalahkan 50 kesatria.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.21,0:17:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu bilang mendapatkan batu ini sendirian?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh, mustahil aku mengelak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.89,0:17:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ma-Maaf, aku menemukan naga hitam\Nyang terluka di hutan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.44,0:18:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena mengecil untuk regenerasi,\Naku kira dia anak burung!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah kusembuhkan pakai ramuan dari Mbak,\Ndia berterima kasih dan kami menjalin kontrak!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.57,0:18:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku lelah, ketiduran, lalu dilindungi Zavilia\Ndari monster yang menyerbu semalaman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Batu sihirnya kuambil dari salah satu mayatnya,\Nmaaf sudah berbohong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.66,0:18:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kontrak penjinakan dengan naga hitam\Nyang melegenda?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anak burung? Raja naga hitam\Nsepertiku dikira anak burung?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekilas terdengar masuk akal,\Ntapi penuh celah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.91,0:18:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ramuan penyembuh terlalu sepele\Ndibanding regenerasi naga purba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kok naga hitam itu bisa tertolong\Nsampai minta kontrak penjinakan segala?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.72,0:18:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat, aku masih dicurigai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster yang dikalahkan hewan kontrak Fia,\Nsama saja dikalahkan olehnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke, upacara berhasil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.86,0:18:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?\NMeski benar, inti masalahnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.11,0:18:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian boleh bubar karena Fia sudah pulang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.88,0:19:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soal naga hitamnya mau kami bahas\Ndengan kepala keluarga, rahasiakan dulu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tertolong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Oria, pembahasannya belum selesai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.44,0:19:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betul, itu seekor naga hitam.\NKita harus lapor ke ordo kesatria.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.13,0:19:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luar biasa, Ayah sangat tahu\Ncara memajukan keluarga kita!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.34,0:19:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus merayakannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.53,0:19:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa maksudmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.13,0:19:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naga hitam itu hewan pelindung Kerajaan Nav.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.86,0:19:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tahu Fia menjalin kontrak dengan naga hitam,\Ndia akan dinikahkan dengan keluarga kerajaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.18,0:19:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan begitu Ayah akan diangkat jadi kapten.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masa besan keluarga kerajaan ditelantarkan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Aku tidak sudi jadi kapten\Npakai cara licik!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kapten harus dipilih berdasarkan kemampuan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.54,0:19:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Para wakil kapten lain pasti menyelamatimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.13,0:19:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Po-Pokoknya, aku tidak akan lapor soal Fia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.64,0:19:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti ada yang salah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.89,0:20:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Itu cuma mirip naga hitam!\NTapi bukan yang asli!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kepala Keluarga Ruud sudah bilang\Ntidak akan melapor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian harus mematuhinya, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya sudahlah, tapi biar kuluruskan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski itu naga hitam, Fia tidak akan dinikahi\Nkeluarga kerajaan maupun bangsawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.79,0:20:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka cuma akan menikahi seorang santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.99,0:20:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ingatlah, Fia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Panggil aku kalau ada apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan adanya kontrak,\Naku bisa mendengarmu dari mana pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.99,0:20:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Zavilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.83,0:20:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sampai jumpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.42,0:20:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, kami akan kembali ke ordo kesatria.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.17,0:20:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.41,0:21:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serangan kali dua, kecepatan kali dua!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luar biasa, tadi itu sihir penguatan fisik?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.84,0:21:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku benaran punya kekuatan santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.58,0:21:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin dengan daya sihir saja,\Nsihir penyembuhan pun bisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.09,0:21:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau cuma pakai daya sihir, aman, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.06,0:21:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Para santa terdahulu\Nmenjalin kontrak dengan roh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster melacak seorang santa\Ndari sisa energi rohnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.48,0:21:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asal tidak mengontrak dan memakai\Nkekuatan roh seharusnya aman...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.19,0:21:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kamu bereinkarnasi jadi santa,\Naku akan mencari dan membunuhmu lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.23,0:21:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kuputuskan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.88,0:22:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebelum dapat rekan yang kuat,\Naku akan merahasiakan bahwa diriku santa!
